  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be completed before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Drawings 02, 03, 04, & Unnumbered Site Location Plan, Daylight, Sunlight, and Overshadowing Study (rev-B), Planning statement, Land Deed- Received on 05/11/2020; Drawings 01a, 06a - Received 27/05/2023) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials used on the external surfaces of the development shall match those used in the building to which it is attached in terms of style, colour, texture and, in the case of brickwork, bonding, coursing and pointing.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to commencement, a report for the management of the construction of the development shall have been submitted to the local planning authority for approval in writing, which sets out the proposed development hours of operation and how any adverse impact of noise, dust, vibration and traffic on adjoining owners or occupiers will be mitigated.",
    "Condition : 5 - The development shall not include a window in any wall or roof slope forming a side elevation of the dwellinghouse.",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof pitch of the principal part of the dwellinghouse following the development shall be the same as the roof pitch of that of the existing dwellinghouse.",
    "Condition : 7 - Following the development, the dwellinghouse must continue to be used as a dwellinghouse within the meaning of Class C3 of the Schedule to the Use Classes Order and shall be used for no other purpose, except to the extent that the other purpose is ancillary to the primary use as a dwellinghouse.",
    "Condition : 8 - Within 28 calendar days of completion of the development hereby approved, the developer shall notify the Local Planning Authority in writing of the completion of the development.\r\nThe notification shall be in writing and shall include the name of the developer; the address of the dwellinghouse; and the date of completion."
  ],
